<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>udp.social — Your family's social network</title>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      background: #f8f4ef;
      color: #2c2c2c;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    header {
      background: #fff;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e8e0d8;
      padding: 1rem 2rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    header .wordmark {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #5c3d2e;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    header .wordmark span {
      color: #c0622a;
    }

    header nav {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0;
    }

    header nav a {
      color: #5c3d2e;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-left: 1.5rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      opacity: 0.7;
    }

    header nav a:hover { opacity: 1; }

    header nav .user-greeting {
      margin-left: 1.5rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: #5c3d2e;
      opacity: 0.85;
    }

    header nav .user-greeting strong {
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .hero {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 5rem auto 3rem;
      padding: 0 2rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .hero .eyebrow {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      color: #c0622a;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.2rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.15;
      color: #1a1a1a;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .hero h1 em {
      font-style: normal;
      color: #c0622a;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #555;
      max-width: 580px;
      margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
    }

    .cta-group {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #c0622a;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 0.9rem 2.2rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1rem;
      transition: background 0.15s;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover { background: #a3501f; }

    .btn-secondary {
      display: inline-block;
      background: transparent;
      color: #5c3d2e;
      padding: 0.9rem 2.2rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 1rem;
      border: 2px solid #c0b09a;
      transition: border-color 0.15s;
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover { border-color: #5c3d2e; }

    .pricing {
      max-width: 860px;
      margin: 0 auto 5rem;
      padding: 0 2rem;
    }

    .pricing h2 {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      color: #1a1a1a;
    }

    .pricing .sub {
      text-align: center;
      color: #777;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .card {
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid #e4dbd0;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 2rem;
    }

    .card.featured {
      border-color: #c0622a;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #c0622a20;
    }

    .card .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #c0622a;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .card h3 {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      color: #1a1a1a;
    }

    .card .price {
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #c0622a;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    .card .price span {
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: #888;
    }

    .card p {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: #666;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .card ul {
      list-style: none;
      margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    }

    .card ul li {
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      color: #444;
      padding: 0.3rem 0;
      padding-left: 1.2rem;
      position: relative;
    }

    .card ul li::before {
      content: "✓";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      color: #c0622a;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .card .card-cta {
      display: block;
      text-align: center;
      background: #c0622a;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      transition: background 0.15s;
    }

    .card .card-cta:hover { background: #a3501f; }

    .card .card-cta.secondary {
      background: transparent;
      color: #5c3d2e;
      border: 2px solid #c0b09a;
    }

    .card .card-cta.secondary:hover { border-color: #5c3d2e; }

    .dev-banner {
      background: #1a1a1a;
      color: #f0c060;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-family: monospace;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem;
      color: #aaa;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      border-top: 1px solid #e8e0d8;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="dev-banner">
    &#9888; dev shim &mdash; blog landing served by FOSSBilling at root (replace with real blog in prod)
    &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;
    Admin: <a href="/admin" style="color:#80d0f0">/admin</a>
  </div>

  <header>
    <div class="wordmark">udp<span>.social</span></div>
    <nav>
      <a href="#">How it works</a>
      <a href="#">Blog</a>
      {% if client %}
        {% set profile = client.profile_get() %}
        <span class="user-greeting">Hi, <strong>{{ profile.first_name }}</strong></span>
        <a href="/user/manage">My Account</a>
        <a href="/logout">Sign out</a>
      {% else %}
        <a href="/login">Sign in</a>
      {% endif %}
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="eyebrow">Your family's social network</div>
      <h1>Social media you <em>actually own.</em><br>No algorithm. No ads.</h1>
      <p>
        Facebook is free. Here's what it costs: your attention, your data,
        your children's development, your privacy. udp.social costs $15/month.
        That's it.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-group">
        <a href="/order/managed-friendica-l1" class="btn-primary">
          Get started &mdash; $15/month
        </a>
        <a href="#pricing" class="btn-secondary">See all options</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pricing" id="pricing">
      <h2>Simple, honest pricing</h2>
      <p class="sub">No hidden fees. No upsells. The price is the price.</p>
      <div class="cards">

        <div class="card featured">
          <div class="badge">Most popular</div>
          <h3>Fully Managed (L1)</h3>
          <div class="price">$15<span>/month</span></div>
          <p>We handle everything. You just use it.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Friendica instance on udp.social</li>
            <li>Updates, backups, infrastructure monitoring</li>
            <li>Support included</li>
            <li>Your subdomain (e.g. smith.udp.social)</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/order/managed-friendica-l1" class="card-cta">
            Get started
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3>Configured Handoff (L2)</h3>
          <div class="price">$75<span> one-time</span></div>
          <p>We set it up, you take over. VPS is yours.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Configured VPS transferred to you</li>
            <li>$3/month update service (required for subdomain)</li>
            <li>$25&ndash;50/incident support</li>
            <li>Your subdomain or bring your own domain</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/order/configured-handoff-l2" class="card-cta secondary">
            Order handoff
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3>DIY (L3)</h3>
          <div class="price">Free</div>
          <p>Set it up yourself with our guide.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Detailed step-by-step blog guide</li>
            <li>Bring your own VPS and domain</li>
            <li>No support (community only)</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="#" class="card-cta secondary">Read the guide</a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    &copy; 2026 UDP Social PBC &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;
    <a href="#" style="color:#aaa">Privacy</a> &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;
    <a href="#" style="color:#aaa">Terms</a>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
